Here's an SCSI regression i tracked down recently. I'll follow up with
more info.

I noticed it in the previous merge window  (i.e. 3 months ago!) but couldnt
properly debug until recently.

The problem is that a 32-bit testbox i have (it has aic7xxx) locks up 
sporadically (often long after bootup) in scsi_request_fn():

